{"seq":24,"slug":"human-computer-interaction","title":"人机交互","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"人机交互\">人机交互</h1><p>人机交互（Human-Computer Interaction，HCI）是研究人与计算机如何交互的学科——交叉计算机科学、心理学、设计、社会学。它让我们理解为什么有些 UI 直观（iPhone、Google search）而有些反直觉（早期 Windows 注册表、企业 ERP）。HCI 不是仅&quot;美化界面&quot;——而是工程化让 software 适应人类认知能力（短期记忆 7±2 chunk、Fitts&#39;s Law 选目标时间、Hick&#39;s Law 选项越多决策越慢）、感知能力（颜色对比、字体大小）、文化差异（左到右 vs 右到左）。Don Norman 1988 <em>Design of Everyday Things</em>、Nielsen 10 heuristics、Apple HIG、Material Design 是 HCI 实战经典。本 Hub 给软件工程师 / 产品设计师工程化路径——HCI 基础（mental model、affordance、Fitts、cognitive load）、交互设计（principles、patterns、prototyping、heuristic eval）、可用性与研究（usability testing、UX research、accessibility、metrics）、新兴交互（voice、AR/VR、gesture）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[人机交互] --&gt; B[1. HCI 基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[2. 交互设计]&#10;    A --&gt; D[3. 可用性与研究]&#10;    A --&gt; E[4. 新兴交互]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Mental model / Affordance / Fitts / Cognitive load]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Principles / Patterns / Prototyping / Heuristics]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Usability testing / UX research / a11y / Metrics]&#10;    E --&gt; I[Voice / AR-VR / Gesture]\">graph TD\n    A[人机交互] --&gt; B[1. HCI 基础]\n    A --&gt; C[2. 交互设计]\n    A --&gt; D[3. 可用性与研究]\n    A --&gt; E[4. 新兴交互]\n    B --&gt; F[Mental model / Affordance / Fitts / Cognitive load]\n    C --&gt; G[Principles / Patterns / Prototyping / Heuristics]\n    D --&gt; H[Usability testing / UX research / a11y / Metrics]\n    E --&gt; I[Voice / AR-VR / Gesture]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>代表实战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HCI 基础</td>\n<td>Mental model、affordance、Fitts、CL</td>\n<td>iPhone、Google</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互设计</td>\n<td>Principles、patterns、prototyping</td>\n<td>Material、HIG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性研究</td>\n<td>Usability、UX research、a11y、metrics</td>\n<td>Nielsen、A/B testing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新兴交互</td>\n<td>Voice、AR/VR、gesture、multimodal</td>\n<td>Siri、Vision Pro</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学完本 Hub 你将能识别 UI 反模式（如 dark pattern）、设计无障碍系统（WCAG 合规）、做基础 usability test、理解 voice / AR/VR 交互的特殊设计原则、用工程化语言讨论 UX。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hci-foundations","title":"HCI 基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/hci-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-hci","title":"什么是 HCI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/hci-foundations/what-is-hci"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mental-models-and-affordances","title":"Mental Model 与 Affordance","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/hci-foundations/mental-models-and-affordances"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fitts-law-and-input","title":"Fitts's Law 与输入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/hci-foundations/fitts-law-and-input"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cognitive-load","title":"认知负荷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/hci-foundations/cognitive-load"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"interaction-design","title":"交互设计","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/interaction-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-principles","title":"设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/interaction-design/design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interaction-patterns","title":"交互模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/interaction-design/interaction-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prototyping-and-iteration","title":"原型与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/interaction-design/prototyping-and-iteration"},{"seq":4,"slug":"heuristic-evaluation","title":"启发式评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/interaction-design/heuristic-evaluation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"usability-and-research","title":"可用性与用户研究","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/usability-and-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usability-testing","title":"可用性测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/usability-and-research/usability-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ux-research-methods","title":"UX 研究方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/usability-and-research/ux-research-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accessibility-and-inclusive","title":"无障碍与包容性设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/usability-and-research/accessibility-and-inclusive"},{"seq":4,"slug":"metrics-and-analytics","title":"度量与分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/usability-and-research/metrics-and-analytics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging-interfaces","title":"新兴交互","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/emerging-interfaces","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"voice-and-conversational","title":"语音与对话式交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/emerging-interfaces/voice-and-conversational"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ar-vr-spatial","title":"AR/VR 与空间计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/emerging-interfaces/ar-vr-spatial"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gesture-and-multimodal","title":"手势与多模态交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/human-computer-interaction/emerging-interfaces/gesture-and-multimodal"}]}]}